actBluetooth.description:
Allow operator to enable/disable Bluetooth interface.

        When actBluetooth is set to:

        enabled: Bluetooth interface is enabled;

        disabled: Bluetooth interface is disabled;

        autoFallback: Bluetooth is enabled automatically upon loss of connection to NetAct and disabled upon restoration of connection.

